WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,580 --> 00:00:02,370
Wife

2
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:04,420
What a big mistake they have committed, and they are not cured

3
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:06,420
It’s really not curable dad

4
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:08,860
You are really my biological father

5
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:10,660
It's not a big deal

6
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,900
The two of them took Yuyou to fry cow dung.

7
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:15,180
It rained cow dung on the entire family

8
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:17,140
I asked you how to spend time with your family in the garden

9
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:18,620
There's a stench filling the air

10
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:19,900
You still know how to call me daddy

11
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:21,580
I think you two are my living fathers

12
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:24,940
You two like left hooks

13
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:26,060
Or a right hook?

14
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:43,280
Why don't you apologize to sister Jiaojiao quickly?

15
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:44,820
You can say sorry

16
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:46,340
But she's not my sister

17
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:48,580
My sister only has King Yoyo

18
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:50,220
Right

19
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:51,300
Stop talking nonsense

20
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:53,900
I'll go home and take care of these two skinny monkeys.

21
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:55,820
I won't bother you anymore
